WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.400
Raundi ya tatu. Ubao wa kwanza.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.200
Mpinzani wako anafungua kwa d4.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.800
Umeona michezo yake. Lakini michezo si mpango.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.800
Kwa hiyo unabahatisha.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.800
Chess Preparatory hugeuza wasifu wowote wa FIDE kuwa mpango.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.300
Mtafute kila mchezaji wa FIDE.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.300
Ona ufunguzi wao, na matokeo yao.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.300
Kisha cheza na boti inayocheza kama wao.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.800
Uliza Mbaku AI cha kutarajia.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.400
Soma kitabu chochote cha chesi kwenye ubao hai.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.800
Na ugundue haiba yako ya chesi.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.900
Chunguza.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.400
Jizoeze.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:46.900
Soma.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.400
Cheza.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.600
Ingia ukiwa na mpango.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:56.600
chesspreparatory.com Jiandae kwa akili.
